  <item>
    <title>探底大众热衷兼职：保险经纪人</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66855f39ada1e8e76febbde7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66855f39ada1e8e76febbde7</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 03 Jul 2024 18:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期邀请到了一位全职保险经纪人@秦菲一起聊聊保险相关的话题，现在很多人都有兼职保险经纪人的意愿，那么要从何开始呢，以及你真的适合吗？菲现在从北京回到了济南生活，同时也在积极发展自己的兼职，比如最近在研究闲鱼的小商机。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>我的理赔故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a>保险经纪人工作内容</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="780">13:00</a>个人保险配置优先级</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1523">25:23</a>养老保险有必要吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1915">31:55</a>保险经纪人是个好职业吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2130">35:30</a>如何成为保险经纪人</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2245">37:25</a>菲的保险经纪人之路</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2360">39:20</a>印象深刻的理赔case</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2465">41:05</a>寻找兼职，闲鱼卖洗地机 0 退货</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2690">44:50</a>回到二线城市的生活</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/liXnAmRXY1YqbTi1C_L58qT9oyfU.m4a" length="49340727" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:50:32</itunes:duration>
